{"result": {"check": "bank", "findings": [{"check": "bank", "rule_id": "BANK-RELIAB-019", "severity": "HIGH", "title": "Unbounded in-memory queue", "detail": "Snap score 0.99 (candidate, not proof). A slow consumer lets the queue grow until the process runs out of memory.", "evidence": [{"file": "module_22.py", "line_start": 3, "line_end": 3, "snippet": "import queue, threading\n\njobs = queue.Queue()\n\ndef producer(source):\n    for item in source:\n        jobs.put(item)\n\ndef worker():\n    while True:\n        handle(jobs.get())\n", "extra": {"window": [0, 2118], "score": 0.9857, "category": "RELIAB", "localized": true, "line_from": "lexical hint"}}], "score": 0.9856919646263123, "source": "snap", "fix_hint": "Set a maximum size and block, drop, or shed load when it is full."}, {"check": "bank", "rule_id": "API-002", "severity": "HIGH", "title": "Mutable default arguments", "detail": "Snap score 0.98 (candidate, not proof). State leaks between calls.", "evidence": [{"file": "module_08.py", "line_start": 1, "line_end": 1, "snippet": "def add_tag(tag, tags=[]):\n    tags.append(tag)\n    return tags\n", "extra": {"window": [0, 2118], "score": 0.9849, "category": "api-design", "localized": true, "line_from": "lexical hint"}}], "score": 0.9848631024360657, "source": "snap", "fix_hint": "Default to None and create inside."}, {"check": "bank", "rule_id": "BANK-RELIAB-013", "severity": "HIGH", "title": "Non-atomic file overwrite", "detail": "Snap score 0.98 (candidate, not proof). A crash mid-write leaves a truncated or empty file that breaks the next start.", "evidence": [{"file": "module_02.py", "line_start": 4, "line_end": 4, "snippet": "import json\n\ndef save_state(path, state):\n    with open(path, 'w') as f:\n        json.dump(state, f)\n", "extra": {"window": [0, 2118], "score": 0.9845, "category": "RELIAB", "localized": true, "line_from": "lexical hint"}}], "score": 0.9844549894332886, "source": "snap", "fix_hint": "Write to a temp file, fsync, then os.repla